==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Shibalien Elite]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 40~43.33 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,300f</sup>.
*1 [[Project A]] spawns as the boss after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*3 [[UltraBaaBaa]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 60~63.33 seconds<sup>1,800f~1,900f</sup>.
*2 [[Star Peng]]s spawn after 83.33 seconds<sup>2,500f</sup>, delay 70~76.67 seconds<sup>2,100f~2,300f</sup>.
*1 [[Ribbo]] spawns after 106.67 seconds<sup>3,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Barrier Breaker is required here, though the spawn rate of UltraBaaBaa is slow enough that Breakerblast is ready for each one. Otherwise not a notable stage. Use an anti-Alien here if you want.

